<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-21T01:46:28.421Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-affiliated militants killed dozens of civilians in an attack in eastern Mali, while gunmen killed over 40 civilians in another incident in Mali. In Niger, gunmen attacked a bus, killing at least 11 people. Burkina Faso's military junta reinstated the death penalty. The conflict continues to affect Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso, where fighting has persisted since 2012. The war caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNRjFLbEVxWmZhTzVxZmJZbTJlY21yQXZUVDhmSXFqNW8wZXlueWxmUWZvcjkwZGVWUXI4VlRzaFlmdUptX3czTjBGdGd5UnQ0dDBabjZCcGNqREFtRENkLVVQT2VmcC04by1xcmdBVG12eS1OOV9mM3MwVGxGMnpCTDRkTjlfMDhySjZUalhqZG9Sa0tBbEdxZVZOVDdxWEF4RVJhUkFaX2hZOTEycUtXS3Eza1g?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigeria Info FM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPNUdPNXc2aUNZTUpKMjRKa0pnN0xvaW9VVHItd0o0NHRGcDF2Nnc4d0Z6QkNCLWx5cEY1YmVtblY2THRja1RXX1dIRWVoSEtHX1VSR3dzb01HQ1VIaTJGMno2NUNKekI5bWZET1pQRm5MeWxqTGF1eS1tU0NFS0JCRERVNkY4OW9BRjVrSHV5a3Njb0tZX0QyWUlaTXppbmNNZktXaTd4TlcyZzBiYU1PbGdncXplaDF6NmxkeEEyeFdEOU5FcW1ZRm53?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.livingstonenterprise.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiO0FVX3lxTFBMMXZhOFdEakwxWjlJcDlDdFhiUTdudExWZ0JiOGpCeHV0ZGdManZwOGVoUkM2UmJsVU9j?oc=5&quot;&gt;Howl.link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRlAzMTVwWXpjQ3Z4RzIyck12Y1djMDh6a3QzVVRZOWVWN21JRGJzRVk2ZURQYjk0MVhTWVlmVGtNMnRPdlVZOFV1UGhycHZFa0N1OWxxNmNvVTJ5dVB2TXJ3anRoZ0VJSHMzZXdsWmN2Z0E1enJfUTlsZkVIZ1p6Tm1sLW0tREE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rs